    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_22e350c0",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts three men in traditional African attire, likely from an ethnic group such as the Maasai, with overlaid text claiming their average IQ is 70-80 and that being 'a few points above being retarded.' This text is a direct, derogatory, and scientifically inaccurate stereotype targeting Black people, using intelligence-related slurs to demean an entire ethnic group. The meme's intent is to perpetuate harmful racial stereotypes by associating Black people with low intelligence, which is a form of hate speech and racial discrimination. The juxtaposition of the dignified, culturally rich visual of the men with the insulting text serves to reinforce a dehumanizing and racist message, making it a hateful meme.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_bcb33abe"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
