      "instance_name": "social_interaction_scene",
      "label": "Three men in traditional attire engaging in social interaction",
      "description": "The scene depicts three shirtless men wearing traditional African attire, likely from the Maasai ethnic group, adorned with colorful beaded necklaces, headbands, and accessories. They are standing outdoors against a backdrop of a clear sky and distant landscape. The men appear to be engaged in conversation or observation, with one man gesturing with his hand near his mouth, another smiling broadly, and the third shielding his eyes as if looking into the distance. The spatial arrangement suggests a casual, communal interaction among peers.",
